{"seq":5,"slug":"network-security","title":"网络安全防御","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"网络安全防御-简介\">网络安全防御 简介</h1><p>网络安全防御是信息安全体系中最基础也最关键的一环，它聚焦于保护网络基础设施、通信链路和数据传输免受未授权访问、恶意攻击和数据泄露。在 2025—2026 年全球网络攻击频率同比增长超过 30%、DDoS 攻击峰值突破 5 Tbps、勒索软件通过网络横向传播造成的平均损失超过 500 万美元的背景下，构建多层次、纵深化的网络防御体系已成为每个组织的生存基线。</p>\n<p>本手册面向网络工程师、安全运维人员和安全架构师，系统讲解从传统边界防御到现代云原生网络安全的完整知识体系。无论你是刚开始学习网络安全的运维工程师，还是正在设计企业网络安全架构的资深从业者，都能从中获得可落地的技术方案和最佳实践。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，由浅入深地覆盖网络安全防御的核心领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>边界防御</strong>从防火墙架构与策略设计出发，讲解入侵检测与防御系统（IDS/IPS）的部署原则，并深入探讨 WAF 与 API 安全防护的最新技术实践。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>安全网络架构</strong>聚焦网络分段与微分段策略、VPN 与安全远程访问方案，以及 SDN 安全与网络可编程化带来的新范式。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>流量分析与监控</strong>介绍网络检测与响应（NDR）解决方案、加密流量分析技术，以及基于 NetFlow 的网络可观测性体系构建。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>新兴威胁防御</strong>覆盖 DDoS 攻击防御体系、IoT/OT 网络安全挑战，以及 5G 与云原生环境下的网络安全新课题。</p>\n<p>建议读者按章节顺序学习，先掌握传统边界防御的基础知识，再理解现代安全架构的设计理念，然后学习流量分析与监控的实战技能，最后关注新兴威胁带来的安全演进方向。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perimeter-defense","title":"边界防御","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/perimeter-defense","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"firewall-architecture","title":"防火墙架构与策略设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/perimeter-defense/firewall-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ids-ips-systems","title":"入侵检测与防御系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/perimeter-defense/ids-ips-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"waf-api-protection","title":"WAF 与 API 安全防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/perimeter-defense/waf-api-protection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-architecture","title":"安全网络架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/network-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-segmentation","title":"网络分段与微分段策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/network-architecture/network-segmentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vpn-secure-access","title":"VPN 与安全远程访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/network-architecture/vpn-secure-access"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sdn-security","title":"SDN 安全与网络可编程化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/network-architecture/sdn-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"traffic-analysis","title":"流量分析与监控","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/traffic-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ndr-solutions","title":"网络检测与响应（NDR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/traffic-analysis/ndr-solutions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encrypted-traffic-analysis","title":"加密流量分析技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/traffic-analysis/encrypted-traffic-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"netflow-monitoring","title":"NetFlow 与网络可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/traffic-analysis/netflow-monitoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-threats","title":"新兴威胁防御","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddos-mitigation","title":"DDoS 攻击防御体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/ddos-mitigation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iot-ot-security","title":"IoT/OT 网络安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/iot-ot-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"5g-cloud-native-security","title":"5G 与云原生网络安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/network-security/emerging-threats/5g-cloud-native-security"}]}]}